{"id": "EUVD-2026-101571", "enisaUuid": "b890f05e-24a2-3e7e-b552-eb6c380db2f2", "description": "Shopizer through 3.2.5 contains an authorization bypass vulnerability that allows authenticated customers to post reviews as other customers by supplying a customerId field. Attackers can send crafted requests to POST /api/v1/auth/products/{id}/reviews to publish reviews and ratings attributed to other store customers, corrupting authorship and product ratings.", "datePublished": "2026-10-14T18:47:57", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T19:38:16", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/shopizer-ecommerce/shopizer/issues/1112", "https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/shopizer-rest-product-review-idor", "https://github.com/shopizer-ecommerce/shopizer/blob/9a1602a664ab882b5420ff4339db45af44a48423/sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/populator/catalog/PersistableProductReviewPopulator.java#L66", "https://github.com/shopizer-ecommerce/shopizer", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/shopizer-through-3.2.5-authorization-bypass-via-product-review-customerid"], "aliases": ["GHSA-pmxj-m85w-6g4g", "CVE-2026-110771"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.22, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "86225506-9c79-3b29-bbc6-cdcfeb6d8a18", "product": {"name": "shopizer", "vendor": {"name": "shopizer-ecommerce"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.2.5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "c81cdb4f-6178-3db7-88b8-eae209a808c1", "vendor": {"name": "Shopizer"}}], "isExploited": false}